              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 28,
                "start": 28
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Francisco, if reliance on the fee were to exist, it would be short\u2011lived, ending at the next negotiating session when new court decisions are incorporated."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
