              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 37,
                "start": 37
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to David L. Franklin, the state, as an employer, has broader authority to impose conditions on employees\u2019 speech than it does when regulating citizens."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Messenger",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "73db12a91b701e312e693efaa9e7d43783bdf6eef4c8f8a7a618cddc5b80b00e",
